      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to measure your peak flow once you've had the first treatment, and I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray, to make sure there's nothing else going on, like a collapsed lung.",
